flowchart TD
    Request["Authenticated creation or regeneration request"] --> Check["Check configuration, requested mode and generation ownership"]
    Check --> Shell["Create or select the template shell and generation job"]
    Shell --> Context["Build bounded story, tone, style and optional blueprint context"]
    Context --> Restore["Validate the input fingerprint and restore staged checkpoints"]
    Restore --> Plan["Reuse a valid plan or request and validate a bounded world plan"]
    Plan --> Details["Generate small detail batches; save valid checkpoints"]
    Details --> Assemble["Assemble and validate the completed draft"]
    Assemble --> Validate["Apply schema, constraints and mode-specific validation"]
    Validate --> Valid{"Valid after bounded per-stage correction?"}
    Valid -->|No| Failed["Report failure or retain a resumable checkpoint"]
    Valid -->|Yes| Apply["Apply through the existing world-persistence owner"]
    Apply --> Visuals["Reuse or generate configured assets; respect generation revision guards"]
    Visuals --> Finish["Run configured final validation and update job status"]
    Finish --> Ready["Publish ready status when the job completes"]
    Failed -.-> Resume["Explicit retry or staged resume"]
    Resume -.-> Check
